  "longBusinessSummary": "Delignit AG, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the development, manufacture, and sale of hardwood-based materials and system solutions based on the natural wood in Germany. The company also provides cargo bay protection and cargo securing systems for light commercial vehicles; systems for rail stock manufacturers; solutions, such as trunk floors in passenger cars, interior equipment for motor caravans, and special floors for factory and logistics buildings. It offers its products and services under the Delignit, VANYCARE, dunacore, Feinholz, Festholz, and Panzerholz brand names. The company was founded in 1799 and is based in Blomberg, Germany. Delignit AG operates as a subsidiary of MBB SE.",
